## Material 3 Theming

- Use `ColorScheme.fromSeed()` for palettes
- Enable `useMaterial3: true` in ThemeData
- Define light and dark themes
- Apply `ThemeData` consistently
- Customize component themes
- Use `Theme.of(context)` for colors
- Implement theme extensions
- Support system theme mode

## Monica Brand Colors

- Primary brand color: `#6366F1` (indigo)
- Use `Color(0xFF6366F1)` for brand color
- Apply `ColorScheme.fromSeed(seedColor: monicaBrandColor)`
- Override primary color in theme
- Maintain brand consistency across app
- Test brand colors in light/dark modes
- Define semantic color variations

```dart
// Monica brand color implementation
class MonicaApp extends StatelessWidget {
  const MonicaApp({super.key});

  static const Color _monicaBrandColor = Color(0xFF6366F1);

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) => MaterialApp(
    theme: ThemeData(
      colorScheme: ColorScheme.fromSeed(
        seedColor: _monicaBrandColor,
      ).copyWith(primary: _monicaBrandColor),
      useMaterial3: true,
    ),
    // ...
  );
}
```

## Color API Updates

- Use `withValues()` instead of deprecated APIs
- Apply `Color.withValues(alpha: 0.5)` for opacity
- Use `Colors.white.withValues(alpha: 0.9)` patterns
- Extract opacity values to constants
- Test transparency in light/dark themes
- Maintain readability with opacity
- Use semantic transparency values

## Color Scheme Organization

- Follow 60-30-10 color rule
- Maintain WCAG contrast ratios
- Use semantic color names
- Define color tokens
- Test in light/dark modes
- Apply consistent color hierarchy
- Avoid hardcoded colors

## Typography

- Define complete `TextTheme`
- Use platform-appropriate fonts
- Maintain readable line height (1.4-1.6x)
- Keep line length 45-75 characters
- Apply consistent font weights
- Use `GoogleFonts` for custom fonts
- Follow Material 3 typography scale

## Theme Extraction Patterns

- Extract `Theme.of(context)` early
- Store theme in local variables
- Use `final ThemeData theme = Theme.of(context)`
- Apply theme colors consistently
- Access colorScheme through theme
- Extract textTheme for typography
- Cache theme values in build methods

